-- │ PLACEHOLDER OWNER UUID: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001                │
-- │                                                                             │
-- │ Every row below is created by this user. On a LOCAL supabase stack the      │
-- │ insert into auth.users below creates it (demo-owner@example.com).           │
-- │ Against a REAL project, replace this UUID with an existing auth.users id    │
-- │ (find yours in Authentication → Users) before running the seed.             │
-- └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
